{"id": "airport-architect-officer-subcontract", "title": "A planning commissioner’s firm took an airport design subcontract", "seconds": 51.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "308ee99122de3956", "words": 147, "beats": [{"scene": "s", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The airport credits this architecture firm on a boarding area completed in 2021.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.7, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "airport-projects", "kicker": "Boarding Area B", "text": "May 2021", "mark": "2021"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.57, 0.93, 1.12, 1.71, 2.0, 2.14, 2.22, 2.58, 2.9, 3.39, 3.51, 3.84]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Five teams bid to improve the airport’s sewage treatment plant.", "t0": 4.82, "t1": 7.76, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "5 proposals", "label": "Mel Leong Treatment Plant"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.63, 0.85, 0.97, 1.33, 1.46, 1.93, 2.25, 2.62]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The airport selected Plant Construction after interviews and cost review.", "t0": 7.88, "t1": 11.35, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "sewer-award", "kicker": "Airport minutes", "text": "Plant Construction", "mark": "Plant"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.55, 0.99, 1.27, 1.88, 2.17, 2.61, 2.75, 3.07]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The prime contractor’s design team included another architecture firm.", "t0": 11.47, "t1": 15.0, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fung-order", "kicker": "The design subcontract", "text": "ED2 International", "mark": "ED2"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.44, 1.07, 1.48, 1.72, 2.19, 2.63, 3.19]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Its president, Frank Fung, owned half the company.", "t0": 15.12, "t1": 17.66, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "50%", "label": "Fung’s stake in ED2"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.67, 1.0, 1.46, 1.76, 1.97, 2.08]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "He also held a seat on San Francisco’s Planning Commission.", "t0": 17.88, "t1": 20.66, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fung-order", "kicker": "Public office", "text": "Planning Commission", "mark": "Planning"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.45, 0.66, 0.74, 0.97, 1.1, 1.31, 1.94, 2.28]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The airport’s records showed his firm received $39,460 for its work.", "t0": 20.78, "t1": 25.75, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$39,460", "label": "Paid to the firm"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.64, 1.0, 1.28, 1.43, 1.71, 2.07, 2.62, 3.08, 3.33, 3.68, 4.03, 4.38, 4.54, 4.7]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "City rules barred officers from taking subcontracts that large.", "t0": 25.87, "t1": 29.14, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fung-order", "kicker": "Contracting prohibition", "text": "City officers", "mark": "officers"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.66, 0.94, 1.33, 1.49, 1.8, 2.63, 2.84]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Investigators also found seven omissions across four financial disclosures.", "t0": 29.26, "t1": 33.36, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "7 omissions", "label": "4 disclosure periods"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.8, 1.12, 1.44, 1.8, 2.29, 2.66, 2.92, 3.42]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "His amended filings identified three different sources of income.", "t0": 33.48, "t1": 36.74, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fung-filings", "kicker": "Amended disclosures", "text": "Zoological Society", "mark": "Zoological"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.61, 1.11, 1.72, 2.0, 2.35, 2.72, 2.84]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Investigators found no evidence of a conflicting Planning Commission matter.", "t0": 36.96, "t1": 40.45, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fung-order", "kicker": "Planning matters", "text": "No evidence", "mark": "evidence"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.79, 1.06, 1.25, 1.63, 1.74, 1.82, 2.42, 2.76, 3.17]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The commission credited his cooperation and assessed $24,200.", "t0": 40.57, "t1": 45.35, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$24,200", "label": "Administrative penalty"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.57, 1.04, 1.19, 2.07, 2.35, 2.73, 3.32, 3.75, 4.01, 4.32]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The order distinguishes the firm’s earnings from his share as an owner.", "t0": 45.47, "t1": 48.56, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fung-order", "kicker": "Penalty calculation", "text": "Ownership share", "mark": "share"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.45, 1.15, 1.27, 1.6, 1.92, 2.11, 2.28, 2.57, 2.69, 2.8]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 48.68, "t1": 50.79, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"s": "The airport contract", "r": "The officer and the disclosures", "p": "The penalty"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "document"}